{
  "name": "基于运放和比较器制作的PID温控PWM风扇调速器",
  "owner_uuid": "ab108d904eb84ff9b4c0f85cfbfc7bbe",
  "creator_uuid": "ab108d904eb84ff9b4c0f85cfbfc7bbe",
  "created_at": "2026-11-09 22:03:16",
  "updated_at": "2026-11-09 22:03:16",
  "modifier_uuid": "ab108d904eb84ff9b4c0f85cfbfc7bbe",
  "content": "<p>使用NTC热敏电阻B3950 20K，R22阻值9.1K为NTC在~=43°C时的阻值，改变R22的阻值即可改变PID的给定温度。</p>\n<p>占空比根据NTC探头温度输入PID电路自动调节，占空比范围0%~100%。</p>\n<p>D1 zmm3v3稳压二极管，设计稳压在3.3v，实测在3.0~3.1附近，故PWM频率只有9.7~9.8KHz，达不到设计目标10KHz，但不太影响性能。</p>\n<p>跪求更好的稳压方法 Orz...</p>\n<p>本人用的风扇在PWM 3KHz以下会有啸叫声，实测9.7KHz听不到。</p>\n<p>实物图<img src=\"https://image.lceda.cn/oshwhub/pullImage/7c3bf8607ace49fda622add862070606.jpg\" alt=\"实物\" width=\"1920\" height=\"2560\"></p>\n<p>框框中温度基本稳定</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://image.lceda.cn/oshwhub/pullImage/56178eb4746742db9af1a561bc012d03.png\" alt=\"框框处温度基本稳定\" width=\"1164\" height=\"804\"></p>\n<p>PWM波形</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://image.lceda.cn/oshwhub/pullImage/7454ed15d9c34254915648ea229a7e0f.jpg\" alt=\"PWM波型\" width=\"1920\" height=\"2560\"></p>\n<p>正在运行</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://image.lceda.cn/oshwhub/pullImage/fa8a960a3314452394b9d38c7d94a269.jpg\" alt=\"运行的样子\" width=\"1920\" height=\"2560\"></p>",
